&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;index.assets/image-20260327202045968.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20260327202045968&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt; 
